<div id="ClsCoppercutopenWhyIDidThis-{{ section.id }}" class="cls-coppercutopen-why-i-did-this">
  <div class="cls-coppercutopen-why-i-did-this__inner">
    <div class="cls-coppercutopen-why-i-did-this__text">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="cls-coppercutopen-why-i-did-this__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.body != blank -%}
        <div class="cls-coppercutopen-why-i-did-this__body cls-coppercutopen-rte">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="cls-coppercutopen-why-i-did-this__photo">
      {%- if section.settings.photo != blank -%}
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.photo | image_url: width: 1280 }}"
          srcset="
            {{ section.settings.photo | image_url: width: 450 }} 450w,
            {{ section.settings.photo | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w,
            {{ section.settings.photo | image_url: width: 1280 }} 1280w
          "
          sizes="100vw"
          alt="{{ section.settings.photo.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ section.settings.photo.width }}"
          height="{{ section.settings.photo.height }}"
        >
      {%- elsif section.settings.photo_fallback != blank -%}
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.photo_fallback | replace: '.jpg', '-900.jpg' | asset_url }}"
          srcset="
            {{ section.settings.photo_fallback | replace: '.jpg', '-450.jpg' | asset_url }} 450w,
            {{ section.settings.photo_fallback | replace: '.jpg', '-900.jpg' | asset_url }} 900w,
            {{ section.settings.photo_fallback | asset_url }} 1280w
          "
          sizes="100vw"
          alt="Nine bottles as they arrived, unstyled, all branding removed"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Why I did this",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "I started with one bottle and a bad feeling"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body copy",
      "default": "<p>Mine was $26. It arrived looking exactly like the photographs, and for about three weeks it was fine.</p><p>Then the finish went at the cap. Not tarnish — tarnish is even and slow and it looks like age. This was a chip, and under the chip was something silver.</p><p><strong>I put a magnet on it. The magnet stayed.</strong></p><p>What bothered me was not the $26. It was that I had spent three weeks drinking <strong>out of it with no idea</strong>, and that if the plating had held a little longer I would still have no idea. There was nothing on the listing, nothing in the packaging and nothing in the product itself that would have told me.</p><p>So I wanted to know how common it was. Not from reviews, and not from other people’s blog posts — <strong>from the inside of the bottles.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "photo",
      "label": "Photo"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "photo_fallback",
      "label": "Photo fallback filename",
      "info": "Used only if no photo is set above. Must be an asset filename already uploaded to this theme.",
      "default": "copper-bottles-cut-open-nine-parcels.jpg"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Why I did this"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
